\subsection{Time-Series Fidelity--Value Analysis}
\label{sec:timeseries_fidelity}

To test the causal direction between reward fidelity degradation and value overestimation, we analyze exp\_066: a single Walker Walk seed (trained $\dt$-embedding, fixed $\dt{=}2$) evaluated at 12 dense checkpoints from 10K to 65K steps (Table~\ref{tab:timeseries_fidelity}).

